  "agentV2RulesSummary": "Core loop: sign characters → schedule performances → earn STORY automatically → upgrade their tier → earn more. Settlement occurs every Monday at 00:00 (UTC); go to the Earnings page to claim. Let characters rest or refill their stamina when it runs out so they can keep working.",
