  "agentV2RulesSalaryExample": "Lin Mengyao · Lv3 Lead · P0=120U (price coefficient ≈1.5046) · heat 3.5\n→ Hourly salary = 5.0 × 1.5046 × 3.5 × 1 = 26.3 STORY\nAs an Lv1 Extra, she would earn only ≈5.3 STORY per hour — upgrading to Lv3 multiplies it fivefold.",
